SUMMARY:Potluck Hike to Lunch Rock
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nWe'll meet at the Folk Art Cente
 r for a hike to Lunch Rock where we will\, wait for it... have lunch! Brin
 g your potluck items (optional) and we'll eat while enjoying an amazing vi
 ew.\n\nThe hike is about 1-1.5 hours each way and I'd consider it a good w
 orkout as the trail goes up and down the whole time. Lunch Rock is a looko
 ut point on top of a large boulder with a nice view. **Please be careful w
 hen we get there as there is a steep drop-off at the end of it.**\n\nPleas
 e try to be on time. As with other Meetup hikes\, if you're late you might
  miss us.\n\nHope to see you there!\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Release of Liability:**\n
