 unction of the organizer is only to organize this event. If you sign up or
  participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily
  agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses and damages arising fro
 m\, as a result of and associated with this event. In addition\, you ackno
 wledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](
 https://www.meetup.com/terms)
