SUMMARY:Drinks at Thirsty Monk South then Steven Spielberg's Disclosure Da
 y
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nWe'll grab dinner and/or drinks 
 at Thirsty Monk South at Biltmore Park at 5:30pm then see Disclosure Day a
 t Regal Biltmore South at 6:50pm. Get your tickets ahead of time here: [ht
 tps://www.regmovies.com/movies/disclosure-day-ho00020460?date=06-27-2026&s
 ite=1892&id=300552](https://www.regmovies.com/movies/disclosure-day-ho0002
 0460?date=06-27-2026&site=1892&id=300552)\n\nLet's watch Steven Spielberg'
 s new movie about aliens/UFOs.\n\nFeel free to debate whether you think 
 👽👽👽 exist in the comments... 🙂\n\nHope to see you there!
